@gateway = http://localhost:5100
@customerService = http://localhost:5101
@orderService = http://localhost:5102
@paymentService = http://localhost:5103
@token = paste-jwt-here

### 1. Gateway health
GET {{gateway}}/health

### 2. Aggregated service health
GET {{gateway}}/health/services

### 3. Service catalog
GET {{gateway}}/catalog

### 4. Request demo JWT
POST {{gateway}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "SOAForge2026!"
}

### Copy accessToken from the previous response into @token.

### 5. List customers through Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: demo-customers-001

### 6. Create customer through Gateway
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-customer-create-001

{
  "name": "SOAForge Demo",
  "email": "demo@novacommerce.local"
}

### 7. List orders through Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: demo-orders-001

### 8. List payments through Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: demo-payments-001

### 9. Gateway metrics
GET {{gateway}}/observability/metrics

### Direct upstream checks remain available for troubleshooting only.
GET {{customerService}}/health

###
GET {{orderService}}/health

###
GET {{paymentService}}/health
